title: 'Decided: an editable folder the new node would leave empty is not redrawn.'
pid: 17458936-abb5-4254-b4c5-a4358429a8a9
body: |2-
  An empty subscribee, overridden or alias folder says the user asked
  for it, to type into. Redrawing one for a node with no members there
  would plant that claim; and switching a search hit back would have
  grown an empty overridden folder the hit never had. The cost: a user
  who had asked for an empty alias folder on the original loses it after
  cycling through a node that has none.
